\section{Per-variable floors}\label{app:pervar}
\input{tables/app_pervar}
Single-variable added values (Table~\ref{tab:pervar}) show that every variable with detectable value at the colour-histogram rung attenuates on HAM10000 and ISIC 2020 (on ISIC 2020, sex and site carry no detectable value at all), whereas on ISIC 2019 anatomical site keeps most of its value. This is consistent with ISIC 2019's large non-redundant share (Table~\ref{tab:retained}) and with BCN20000's deliberate inclusion of hard-to-diagnose sites~\cite{combalia2019bcn}.

